<div class="page-padding">

  <h1 class="page-title">Adidas Samba Millennium Campaign</h1>

  <div class="community-header">
    At the center of the campaign is the tagline “Good for a Millennium”. It came from our feelings about the shoe; that it’s an all-time design and it will look good now just as it will next year and the year after that. Taking that idea to its extreme, we put the Millennium in different time periods; whether it was a woman in the 1800s, a cowboy from the American West, or a Knight of the Round Table, it always looks good. 
  </div>
  
